再豐富也要照醫院標準作業做。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"關心與尊重病人"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，保護隱私，"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"充分告知"}]},{"type":"text","value":"(不可選擇性告知或隱瞞風險)。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"熟知護理人員法等法令，確實依法執業。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"誠實、完整、及時"}]},{"type":"text","value":"的護理紀錄。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"建立"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"異常事件通報與檢討"}]},{"type":"text","value":"機制，推動病人安全文化。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"護理主管"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"建立技術與常規的 SOP"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；護理人員之間"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"適度互相支援"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，避免負荷過重。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}},{"id":"handling","depth":2,"number":"三、","title":"糾紛發生時的處理","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"病人或家屬抱怨"}]},{"type":"text","value":"要"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"即時傾聽、同理"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，不拖到隔天；護理長"},{"type":"element","tagName"